		<td width="150" align="left" valign="top" class="row1"><span class="name"><a name="17255"></a><b>ErikModi</b></span><br /><span class="postdetails">Neophyte<br /><img src="images/Ranks/swords/2sword.gif" alt="Neophyte" title="Neophyte" border="0" /><br /><br /><br />Joined: 23 Jan 2003<br />Posts: 63<br /></span><br /></td>
		<td class="row1" width="100%" height="28" valign="top"><table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">
			<tr>
				<td width="100%"><a href="viewtopic.php?p=17255&amp;sid=3156be4c22b93afb54d7a861b681a134#17255"><img src="templates/Chronicles/images/icon_minipost.gif" width="12" height="9" alt="Post" title="Post" border="0" /></a><span class="postdetails">Posted: Fri Jun 11, 2004 10:05 am<span class="gen">&nbsp;</span>&nbsp; &nbsp;Post subject: The fate of the Concordat.</span></td>
				<td valign="top" align="right" nowrap="nowrap"><a href="posting.php?mode=quote&amp;p=17255&amp;sid=3156be4c22b93afb54d7a861b681a134"><img src="templates/Chronicles/images/lang_english/icon_quote.gif" alt="Reply with quote" title="Reply with quote" border="0" /></a>   </td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><hr /></td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">Now, I'd normally post this in RP, since I think we could have a really good discussion there, but I think this needs to be addressed OOC.
<br />

<br />
Despite having so many members in the guild management tool, I haven't seen anyone on at the same time as me in weeks.  Granted, I haven't been on Arriik as much as would have liked, but in checking the guild management tool, I've found that only four people (aside from Arriik and Majandra, an alt of mine) have been on in the last three days.  The next most recent log on was a month ago.  And there's far more 03's then 04's in these dates.
<br />

<br />
I'm not pointing fingers or laying blame or being antagonistic.  But I am seriously asking:  Where is everyone?  Who is doing what that's preventing them from logging on their CA toons?  RL interfering, mains in raiding guilds, alts on other servers, left EQ for SWG or WoW?  Whatever your reasoning, I'm sure it's valid.  I just need to know. . . are we, as a guild, okay, or are we hanging onto something that died a long time ago, and we just haven't admitted it yet?
<br />

<br />
I need responses ASAP.</span><span class="gentblsmall"></span></td>
			</tr>
