		<td width="150" align="left" valign="top" class="row2"><span class="name"><a name="17256"></a><b>Ceowulfe</b></span><br /><span class="postdetails">Accolyte<br /><img src="images/Ranks/swords/1sword.gif" alt="Accolyte" title="Accolyte" border="0" /><br /><br /><br />Joined: 01 Oct 2003<br />Posts: 41<br />Location: Front Royal Virginia</span><br /></td>
		<td class="row2" width="100%" height="28" valign="top"><table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">
			<tr>
				<td width="100%"><a href="viewtopic.php?p=17256&amp;sid=3156be4c22b93afb54d7a861b681a134#17256"><img src="templates/Chronicles/images/icon_minipost.gif" width="12" height="9" alt="Post" title="Post" border="0" /></a><span class="postdetails">Posted: Fri Jun 11, 2004 11:39 am<span class="gen">&nbsp;</span>&nbsp; &nbsp;Post subject: </span></td>
				<td valign="top" align="right" nowrap="nowrap"><a href="posting.php?mode=quote&amp;p=17256&amp;sid=3156be4c22b93afb54d7a861b681a134"><img src="templates/Chronicles/images/lang_english/icon_quote.gif" alt="Reply with quote" title="Reply with quote" border="0" /></a>   </td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><hr /></td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">I have been on many times in the past months:
<br />

<br />
Glint - Gnome Cleric...now level 30
<br />

<br />
Felemid - Half Elven Bard....now 23
<br />

<br />
Ceowulf has been semi inactvie while I have been leveling the Glint.
<br />

<br />

<br />
I have seen only Jadorm (sp) a Barb Shaman on at the same time.  It is unfortunate that we can not group together more, but it is good that several times folks have seen my CA tag and commented  how they remember the Guild from their younger days.  Most of them quickly fall into a roll play mode once you get them going.  Well, except for a few of the Iksars...I think they took it personal  <img src="images/smiles/icon_twisted.gif" alt="icon_twisted.gif" border="0" />   Silly leezards  <img src="images/smiles/icon_biggrin.gif" alt="icon_biggrin.gif" border="0" /> 
<br />

<br />
So, if Glint, Felemid and Ceo have not shown up in the Guild Tool, I do not know why.    
<br />

<br />
If you need anymore info, let me know.
<br />

<br />
Tommie
<br />
the Guy behind Ceo, Glint and Felemid.  (Man, the shrinks would LOVE to get  me on a couch I bet!)</span><span class="gentblsmall"></span></td>
