		<td width="150" align="left" valign="top" class="row1"><span class="name"><a name="17259"></a><b>Drakanos Shuurai</b></span><br /><span class="postdetails">Accolyte<br /><img src="images/Ranks/swords/1sword.gif" alt="Accolyte" title="Accolyte" border="0" /><br /><img src="images/avatars/18117008284042a6ff55fd1.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br /><br />Joined: 13 Nov 2002<br />Posts: 37<br /></span><br /></td>
		<td class="row1" width="100%" height="28" valign="top"><table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">
			<tr>
				<td width="100%"><a href="viewtopic.php?p=17259&amp;sid=3156be4c22b93afb54d7a861b681a134#17259"><img src="templates/Chronicles/images/icon_minipost.gif" width="12" height="9" alt="Post" title="Post" border="0" /></a><span class="postdetails">Posted: Sun Jun 13, 2004 5:35 pm<span class="gen">&nbsp;</span>&nbsp; &nbsp;Post subject: </span></td>
				<td valign="top" align="right" nowrap="nowrap"><a href="posting.php?mode=quote&amp;p=17259&amp;sid=3156be4c22b93afb54d7a861b681a134"><img src="templates/Chronicles/images/lang_english/icon_quote.gif" alt="Reply with quote" title="Reply with quote" border="0" /></a>   </td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><hr /></td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">I hate to admit it, but I'd say that the CA is going under, at least in my perspective. I haven't played EQ, let alone on Druzzil Ro, for the past 2 or 3 weeks. I just find that EverQuest is lacking when it comes to roleplaying. There's just too few roleplayers, now. Even on Firiona Vie, there are many non-RPers. I've mostly been playing Neverwinter Nights on RPing servers, where people actually roleplay out of their own free will. EverQuest is dead to me now, probably because of the constant expansions and add-ons that keep making the game easier and less fun to play. Concordat Angelis is the best guild that EQ ever had, to me. If I do get World of Warcraft and they do have a Roleplaying server, I plan on rebuilding the Concordat Angelis there, if it does fade from existance in EQ.<br />_________________<br /><img src="http://reconsoutpost.homestead.com/files/images/blackfist.gif" border="0" />
<br />
<a href="http://www.magelo.com/eq_view_profile.html?num=481180" target="_blank" class="postlink">Drakanos Shuurai</a>, Monk of the 55th Rung, Master of the Swift Tail Caste</span><span class="gentblsmall"></span></td>
			</tr>
