	<tr>
		<td width="150" align="left" valign="top" class="row2"><span class="name"><a name="17261"></a><b>Ceowulfe</b></span><br /><span class="postdetails">Accolyte<br /><img src="images/Ranks/swords/1sword.gif" alt="Accolyte" title="Accolyte" border="0" /><br /><br /><br />Joined: 01 Oct 2003<br />Posts: 41<br />Location: Front Royal Virginia</span><br /></td>
		<td class="row2" width="100%" height="28" valign="top"><table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">
			<tr>
				<td width="100%"><a href="viewtopic.php?p=17261&amp;sid=3156be4c22b93afb54d7a861b681a134#17261"><img src="templates/Chronicles/images/icon_minipost.gif" width="12" height="9" alt="Post" title="Post" border="0" /></a><span class="postdetails">Posted: Mon Jun 14, 2004 4:44 am<span class="gen">&nbsp;</span>&nbsp; &nbsp;Post subject: </span></td>
				<td valign="top" align="right" nowrap="nowrap"><a href="posting.php?mode=quote&amp;p=17261&amp;sid=3156be4c22b93afb54d7a861b681a134"><img src="templates/Chronicles/images/lang_english/icon_quote.gif" alt="Reply with quote" title="Reply with quote" border="0" /></a>   </td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><hr /></td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">I am afraid I agree with you Drakanos in many of your views.  I tried FV for a time, but it seems the lure of the non NO DROP sucked many over and they have turned into a normal sever at this point.  I actually was kicked from a group because I refused to heal / assist an ogre.  C'mon, I was a dwarf!!!  WE HATE OGRES!?  So, I bagged it.  CA will remain a guild as long as we have 10 registered folks on different accounts I think.  Unless we decide to disband?  But what does that get us?  I would rather carry my CA tag and keep our memory going in what little ways I can.  We never were a raiding guild, never concerned with the ultimate end game that I remember, just folks having fun.  
<br />

<br />
It is sad that they have made the game so much easier than it was before, but it is done now and I just smile and plow into the baddies in the same way as always.  
<br />

<br />
If you do start up CA in WoW, drop us a line here.  I would love to hear about it.  
<br />

<br />
Take care and be safe,  it was always fun hunting with you.  
<br />

<br />

<br />
Ceowulf
<br />
Champion to the Concordat</span><span class="gentblsmall"></span></td>
			</tr>
